  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Physical Climate Risk Assessment Methodology (PCRAM) 2.0.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the PCRAM methodology towards the publication of PCRAM 2.0.

Extending the learnings from the first round of PCRAM case studies, involving key CCRI members, and broadening the base of case studies is key to continued demonstration of the methodology&#x2019;s efficacy and its development as a proof of concept that can form the basis for industry standards.

To mainstream PCRAM through socialisation with investors and integration into relevant Institutional Investors Group on Climate Change (IIGCC) frameworks, namely the Climate Resilience Investment Framework (CRIF).</narrative>
  </description>
